WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.305 --> 00:00:04.191
- Fear is the resistance to
what it is that you desire.

00:00:04.191 --> 00:00:05.947
And in the absence of resistance,

00:00:05.947 --> 00:00:07.640
you become a magnet for what you desire.

00:00:07.640 --> 00:00:11.152
Your successes will come
when you commit to joy,

00:00:11.152 --> 00:00:12.729
when you commit to happiness.

00:00:12.729 --> 00:00:14.291
You could say all the right things,

00:00:14.291 --> 00:00:16.060
but if you don't think it,

00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:20.241
if you don't transform and
clean up your thinking,

00:00:20.241 --> 00:00:22.723
then you're literally
polluting the planet.

00:00:22.723 --> 00:00:24.834
- She's a motivational
speaker, life coach,

00:00:24.834 --> 00:00:26.445
and spirit junkie.

00:00:26.445 --> 00:00:28.548
She's a New York Times best selling author

00:00:28.548 --> 00:00:30.546
of the Universe Has Your Back.

00:00:30.546 --> 00:00:33.401
Her flagship course, A
Spirit Junkie Masterclass,

00:00:33.401 --> 00:00:36.046
empowers people to live their best self.

00:00:36.046 --> 00:00:38.103
She's Gabrielle Berstein
and here's my take

00:00:38.103 --> 00:00:40.202
on her top 10 rules to success.

00:00:40.202 --> 00:00:41.905
Rule number one is my personal favorite

00:00:41.905 --> 00:00:44.255
and I'd love to know which
one you guys like the best.

00:00:44.255 --> 00:00:45.527
And as always as you're watching,

00:00:45.527 --> 00:00:47.705
if you hear something that
really resonates with you,

00:00:47.705 --> 00:00:49.364
please leave it in the comments below.

00:00:49.364 --> 00:00:52.334
Put quotes around it so other
people can be inspired as well

00:00:52.334 --> 00:00:53.626
and when you write it down,

00:00:53.626 --> 00:00:56.395
it's much more likely to
stick with you as well.

00:00:56.395 --> 00:00:57.228
Enjoy.

00:01:00.236 --> 00:01:02.819
(upbeat music)

00:01:10.514 --> 00:01:11.996
- Don't wait.

00:01:11.996 --> 00:01:12.872
Go.

00:01:12.872 --> 00:01:13.705
Do it.

00:01:13.705 --> 00:01:14.538
Act now.

00:01:16.217 --> 00:01:18.976
And really accepting we need
you, we need you, we need you.

00:01:18.976 --> 00:01:20.181
You are the 1%.

00:01:20.181 --> 00:01:23.152
You're the percent that
says, "I'm going to wake up."

00:01:23.152 --> 00:01:24.142
You are the light workers.

00:01:24.142 --> 00:01:26.871
You are the ones that
have accepted this call

00:01:26.871 --> 00:01:28.473
in this lifetime at this time.

00:01:28.473 --> 00:01:31.168
You have decided to wake
up and chosen to say,

00:01:31.168 --> 00:01:32.699
"Yes, I'm here to be of greater service

00:01:32.699 --> 00:01:34.646
"than just to feed myself," right?

00:01:34.646 --> 00:01:35.715
I'm here to feed the world.

00:01:35.715 --> 00:01:36.621
I'm here to give love.

00:01:36.621 --> 00:01:38.732
I'm here to be an
expression of that truth.

00:01:38.732 --> 00:01:40.482
Don't hold that back.

00:01:42.797 --> 00:01:44.214
Don't play small.

00:01:45.318 --> 00:01:46.310
We can't.

00:01:46.310 --> 00:01:47.832
We need you.

00:01:47.832 --> 00:01:50.252
And so really, if you
are anyone in this room

00:01:50.252 --> 00:01:53.502
who has been sitting on that book idea,

00:01:54.381 --> 00:01:55.455
waiting a little bit longer

00:01:55.455 --> 00:01:58.099
before you start that teacher training,

00:01:58.099 --> 00:01:59.892
or doing 10 more teacher trainings

00:01:59.892 --> 00:02:01.221
before you actually teach,

00:02:01.221 --> 00:02:03.471
(laughter)

00:02:04.367 --> 00:02:06.664
if that's you guys,

00:02:06.664 --> 00:02:09.310
start and the pressure will be off.

00:02:09.310 --> 00:02:10.592
I can't begin to tell you.

00:02:10.592 --> 00:02:13.006
I could cry just saying this.

00:02:13.006 --> 00:02:14.692
The day I taught Ego Eradicator,

00:02:14.692 --> 00:02:17.264
I was two weeks into my teacher training

00:02:17.264 --> 00:02:19.744
and I said, "F it, let's go!"

00:02:19.744 --> 00:02:22.951
And I just went and I
felt so much pressure off.

00:02:22.951 --> 00:02:26.262
I felt so much lift because I just knew.

00:02:26.262 --> 00:02:28.241
I felt this technology must be shared.

00:02:28.241 --> 00:02:29.440
I can't hold it.

00:02:29.440 --> 00:02:30.849
I can't keep it for myself.

00:02:30.849 --> 00:02:33.247
I can't just sit in my
apartment by myself like this.

00:02:33.247 --> 00:02:34.592
I got to give this.

00:02:34.592 --> 00:02:37.115
(laughter)

00:02:37.115 --> 00:02:39.925
And sharing it, the pressure just lifted.

00:02:39.925 --> 00:02:41.704
It was like (sighs).

00:02:41.704 --> 00:02:43.423
Thank you, thank you, thank you.

00:02:43.423 --> 00:02:45.367
And I wasn't the perfect
teacher and I look back

00:02:45.367 --> 00:02:47.193
and I was teaching Ego Eradicator wrong.

00:02:47.193 --> 00:02:48.592
Everyone's arms were like this.

00:02:48.592 --> 00:02:49.959
Everyone was breathing backwards.

00:02:49.959 --> 00:02:50.792
It was a mess.

00:02:50.792 --> 00:02:53.096
But I did it and I started.

00:02:53.096 --> 00:02:56.839
And in those moments when
we just to go, just go,

00:02:56.839 --> 00:02:59.406
the pressure's off and
then we clear the path

00:02:59.406 --> 00:03:01.753
and we are guided to
the next right action.

00:03:01.753 --> 00:03:04.017
And that is the most magnificent thing

00:03:04.017 --> 00:03:05.353
we could do right now.

00:03:05.353 --> 00:03:07.054
- What's the first step
to overcoming the fear

00:03:07.054 --> 00:03:09.123
or transforming the fear?

00:03:09.123 --> 00:03:10.484
- To witness it.

00:03:10.484 --> 00:03:13.373
To be the nonjudgmental witness of it.

00:03:13.373 --> 00:03:17.176
To look at it and say,
"Something's got to give," right?

00:03:17.176 --> 00:03:21.343
So if you're unwilling to
look at your fear head on

00:03:22.426 --> 00:03:24.654
and honor it and witness.

00:03:24.654 --> 00:03:26.754
I always say if you don't
show up for what's up

00:03:26.754 --> 00:03:28.449
it will keep showing up.

00:03:28.449 --> 00:03:30.752
So looking and saying I
witnessed my resistance

00:03:30.752 --> 00:03:33.320
and you see that fear as resistance.

00:03:33.320 --> 00:03:37.183
Fear is the resistance to
what it is that you desire.

00:03:37.183 --> 00:03:39.020
And in the absence of resistance,

00:03:39.020 --> 00:03:40.955
you become a magnet for what you desire.

00:03:40.955 --> 00:03:42.583
And when you let go of that fear

00:03:42.583 --> 00:03:44.193
and you transcend that fear,

00:03:44.193 --> 00:03:46.970
that's when you start to
become a super attractor.

00:03:46.970 --> 00:03:50.723
That's when you start to let what is truly

00:03:50.723 --> 00:03:52.783
of essence for you into your life.

00:03:52.783 --> 00:03:54.570
What is truly of service
for you into your life.

00:03:54.570 --> 00:03:56.183
What is true happiness into your life.

00:03:56.183 --> 00:03:58.942
And so looking at the fear, witnessing it,

00:03:58.942 --> 00:04:00.138
calling it by its name.

00:04:00.138 --> 00:04:02.652
And even if you don't have the tools yet,

00:04:02.652 --> 00:04:04.680
what happens is when you look
at the fear and you're like

00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:07.118
oh, I see this fear,
I see this resistance,

00:04:07.118 --> 00:04:08.848
I see how it's blocking my life

00:04:08.848 --> 00:04:10.537
and I chose to see it differently.

00:04:10.537 --> 00:04:12.764
That's when you listen
to an audio like this.

00:04:12.764 --> 00:04:14.585
That's when a book like yours
will fall off the shelf.

00:04:14.585 --> 00:04:16.032
- A catalyst will open up.
- Yeah.

00:04:16.032 --> 00:04:18.299
Exactly, you open up your
consciousness, pretty much.

00:04:18.299 --> 00:04:20.333
You crack open your
consciousness to find solutions

00:04:20.333 --> 00:04:21.872
rather than find problems.
- Right.

00:04:21.872 --> 00:04:23.317
- And so when you're
not looking at the fear,

00:04:23.317 --> 00:04:24.484
you're just living in the fear

00:04:24.484 --> 00:04:25.767
and you're believing in the problem.

00:04:25.767 --> 00:04:26.766
But when you witness the fear

00:04:26.766 --> 00:04:28.049
and you're willing to see it differently,

00:04:28.049 --> 00:04:29.496
you start living in the solution.

00:04:29.496 --> 00:04:32.079
As I commit to happiness fully,

00:04:32.920 --> 00:04:35.190
exactly what I need is coming towards me

00:04:35.190 --> 00:04:36.682
because I become a magnet.

00:04:36.682 --> 00:04:40.730
I become an energy field
that is so magnetizing,

00:04:40.730 --> 00:04:43.498
that is so excited, that's so inspired

00:04:43.498 --> 00:04:47.555
that other people want to support
and work with that energy.

00:04:47.555 --> 00:04:51.773
And so when we dwell in the
energy of joy and happiness,

00:04:51.773 --> 00:04:54.305
we become a magnet for
that which we desire.

00:04:54.305 --> 00:04:56.901
So my hope for you all
is to start to think

00:04:56.901 --> 00:04:59.668
about the things that
you want to succeed in.

00:04:59.668 --> 00:05:01.741
Whether it's succeeding
in romantic relationships

00:05:01.741 --> 00:05:03.433
or succeeding in your career

00:05:03.433 --> 00:05:05.296
or succeeding in your health goals

00:05:05.296 --> 00:05:08.611
and make a commitment
today to bring more joy

00:05:08.611 --> 00:05:10.887
to that area of your life.

00:05:10.887 --> 00:05:13.080
Rather than seeing it as a struggle,

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:15.601
rather than pushing
forward with all this angst

00:05:15.601 --> 00:05:19.173
and negativity and neediness and control,

00:05:19.173 --> 00:05:20.814
just bring joy to it.

00:05:20.814 --> 00:05:24.445
Your successes will come
when you commit to joy,

00:05:24.445 --> 00:05:26.140
when you commit to happiness.

00:05:26.140 --> 00:05:29.565
So find more joy in
that physical exercise.

00:05:29.565 --> 00:05:30.759
I've been going to soul cycle.

00:05:30.759 --> 00:05:31.630
I absolutely love it.

00:05:31.630 --> 00:05:35.222
It's so joyful for me and
that's helping me raise my butt

00:05:35.222 --> 00:05:37.494
'cause that was one of
my goals in success.

00:05:37.494 --> 00:05:39.239
And then we have these moments

00:05:39.239 --> 00:05:41.932
where we want to really
bring joy into our career.

00:05:41.932 --> 00:05:44.176
Well if you're having a
hard time in the office,

00:05:44.176 --> 00:05:46.413
just find ways to have more fun.

00:05:46.413 --> 00:05:48.610
And as we start to elevate
that presence of joy,

00:05:48.610 --> 00:05:52.017
we will begin to magnetize
the successes in our life.

00:05:52.017 --> 00:05:53.503
And so take this very seriously.

00:05:53.503 --> 00:05:55.932
Bring this practice into
your day to day experiences

00:05:55.932 --> 00:05:59.061
and make joy and happiness
your number one priority

00:05:59.061 --> 00:06:03.015
and recognize how your
successes will be brought to you

00:06:03.015 --> 00:06:05.835
in a form far greater than
you could ever imagine

00:06:05.835 --> 00:06:09.233
when your primary focus is happiness.

00:06:09.233 --> 00:06:11.014
Once you make that willingness to change,

00:06:11.014 --> 00:06:13.368
the book falls off the shelf

00:06:13.368 --> 00:06:15.065
or the teacher shows up in a form

00:06:15.065 --> 00:06:17.895
that you could have never imagined

00:06:17.895 --> 00:06:21.832
or you hear something on the
radio or you meet a cab driver

00:06:21.832 --> 00:06:25.209
or some enlightened conversation
comes into your realm

00:06:25.209 --> 00:06:27.394
that all the sudden is
that shift that you needed

00:06:27.394 --> 00:06:29.461
to make that change and
create that catalyst

00:06:29.461 --> 00:06:32.194
that becomes your greatest accomplishment,

00:06:32.194 --> 00:06:33.515
your greatest shift.

00:06:33.515 --> 00:06:35.346
And so that's all we need at first

00:06:35.346 --> 00:06:38.680
is that slight willingness,
that willingness that I had,

00:06:38.680 --> 00:06:41.488
that desire to change,
that moment to shift,

00:06:41.488 --> 00:06:45.488
was all I needed to become
the woman I am today.

00:06:46.685 --> 00:06:50.315
To live that life beyond
my wildest dreams.

00:06:50.315 --> 00:06:52.826
And so when I became ready,

00:06:52.826 --> 00:06:55.231
I opened up and I said,
"Okay, I'm ready for change."

00:06:55.231 --> 00:06:56.521
But what's beautiful

00:06:56.521 --> 00:06:58.133
and what is the main
purpose of what I teach

00:06:58.133 --> 00:07:00.606
is that once you make
that decision to change,

00:07:00.606 --> 00:07:03.291
you do not have to do it by yourself.

00:07:03.291 --> 00:07:06.020
You cannot be expected to make
these changes on your own.

00:07:06.020 --> 00:07:09.499
All you need is that slight willingness.

00:07:09.499 --> 00:07:10.659
If you're resenting somebody else,

00:07:10.659 --> 00:07:13.355
you're really just unconsciously
resenting yourself.

00:07:13.355 --> 00:07:17.107
So witnessing very quickly
who do I need to forgive?

00:07:17.107 --> 00:07:18.421
Is it me, is it somebody else?

00:07:18.421 --> 00:07:21.437
And very quickly turning it back onto you

00:07:21.437 --> 00:07:23.506
and choosing the pathway of forgiveness.

00:07:23.506 --> 00:07:25.992
Forgiving yourself for
having a judgmental thought.

00:07:25.992 --> 00:07:28.248
Forgiving yourself for being an attack.

00:07:28.248 --> 00:07:32.415
Forgiving yourself for having
a feeling that is unkind.

00:07:33.256 --> 00:07:36.429
Forgiving yourself for being
judgmental towards yourself

00:07:36.429 --> 00:07:38.160
or attacking towards yourself.

00:07:38.160 --> 00:07:41.355
Whatever's up for the moment,
just practice the F word.

00:07:41.355 --> 00:07:45.502
And if you can't get to the
feeling of forgiving yourself,

00:07:45.502 --> 00:07:48.763
say that you are willing
to forgive yourself.

00:07:48.763 --> 00:07:50.372
Just saying in that moment,

00:07:50.372 --> 00:07:53.934
"I am willing to forgive myself for X Y Z.

00:07:53.934 --> 00:07:56.959
"I am willing to forgive myself
for being in this bad mood.

00:07:56.959 --> 00:07:59.438
"I'm willing to forgive
myself for what I just said.

00:07:59.438 --> 00:08:02.206
"I'm willing to forgive myself
for what I'm holding on to."

00:08:02.206 --> 00:08:04.558
And just opening yourself
up to the practice

00:08:04.558 --> 00:08:07.997
of self forgiveness will change
your mood and your energy

00:08:07.997 --> 00:08:09.312
in a minute or less.

00:08:09.312 --> 00:08:11.001
I swear by this.

00:08:11.001 --> 00:08:15.045
This is probably the key to
my freedom, my happiness,

00:08:15.045 --> 00:08:18.634
my successes is my
willingness to forgive myself.

00:08:18.634 --> 00:08:21.850
So take that in and
really own that for you

00:08:21.850 --> 00:08:23.823
and practice the F word all the time.

00:08:23.823 --> 00:08:25.687
So the next time you notice
yourself in a bad mood,

00:08:25.687 --> 00:08:28.381
it might just be right
in this moment right now,

00:08:28.381 --> 00:08:30.952
just say, "I'm willing to forgive myself."

00:08:30.952 --> 00:08:32.770
And see what unfolds.

00:08:32.770 --> 00:08:34.131
See how your energy changes.

00:08:34.131 --> 00:08:36.742
See how your feelings begin to shift

00:08:36.742 --> 00:08:39.972
and see that bad mood
just dissipate instantly.

00:08:39.972 --> 00:08:41.623
There are no idle thoughts.

00:08:41.623 --> 00:08:44.643
So if you want to live a mindful life,

00:08:44.643 --> 00:08:48.779
you have to recognize the
magnitude of your thinking.

00:08:48.779 --> 00:08:52.994
If you're sitting here and
you're judging your loved ones

00:08:52.994 --> 00:08:54.444
or you're judging a friend,

00:08:54.444 --> 00:08:56.708
you're weakening your own energy

00:08:56.708 --> 00:08:58.232
and you're weakening theirs.

00:08:58.232 --> 00:09:00.094
Every being around you in some way

00:09:00.094 --> 00:09:02.112
is picking up the
frequency of your thoughts.

00:09:02.112 --> 00:09:03.849
Some people are looking at me perplexed.

00:09:03.849 --> 00:09:05.497
Like what the hell is she talking about?

00:09:05.497 --> 00:09:07.042
Right now I can hear your thoughts.

00:09:07.042 --> 00:09:08.686
(laughter)

00:09:08.686 --> 00:09:10.345
I can, I know exactly
what you're thinking.

00:09:10.345 --> 00:09:11.913
(laughter)

00:09:11.913 --> 00:09:14.938
It's not that I can hear
it, it's that I can feel it.

00:09:14.938 --> 00:09:15.796
Think about it.

00:09:15.796 --> 00:09:16.991
You could be in those relationships

00:09:16.991 --> 00:09:20.744
where your boss and you
do everything perfectly,

00:09:20.744 --> 00:09:21.825
but in your head you're like I hate you,

00:09:21.825 --> 00:09:23.399
I hate you, I hate you, I hate you.

00:09:23.399 --> 00:09:25.839
And they don't want to promote you.

00:09:25.839 --> 00:09:26.947
They don't want to support you.

00:09:26.947 --> 00:09:29.260
There's constant tension
within the relationship.

00:09:29.260 --> 00:09:31.033
You could say all the right things,

00:09:31.033 --> 00:09:32.775
but if you don't think it,

00:09:32.775 --> 00:09:36.774
if you don't transform and
clean up your thinking,

00:09:36.774 --> 00:09:39.002
then you're literally
polluting the planet.

00:09:39.002 --> 00:09:40.029
So first and foremost,

00:09:40.029 --> 00:09:41.387
we got to think about what we're thinking.

00:09:41.387 --> 00:09:43.165
And so how do we change those thoughts?

00:09:43.165 --> 00:09:44.568
Because you might be thinking
okay, that sounds great,

00:09:44.568 --> 00:09:47.335
but I'm down negative Nancy lane

00:09:47.335 --> 00:09:50.429
and I don't know how to change direction.

00:09:50.429 --> 00:09:52.465
How do I make a u-turn?

00:09:52.465 --> 00:09:53.947
All right, so some simple tools.

00:09:53.947 --> 00:09:55.930
First and foremost, witness it.

00:09:55.930 --> 00:09:56.763
Yesterday I was saying this.

00:09:56.763 --> 00:09:59.485
Look at your crazy and
call it by its name.

00:09:59.485 --> 00:10:00.967
It's fear.

00:10:00.967 --> 00:10:03.250
When you see those crazy
thoughts show up in your life,

00:10:03.250 --> 00:10:05.657
when you hear those thoughts
of I'm not good enough,

00:10:05.657 --> 00:10:08.554
I'm better than, that person's terrible,

00:10:08.554 --> 00:10:09.870
I have two choices.

00:10:09.870 --> 00:10:12.251
I can continue down the road

00:10:12.251 --> 00:10:14.196
and I can continue down that dark path,

00:10:14.196 --> 00:10:16.065
or I can actually pivot.

00:10:16.065 --> 00:10:18.053
I can redirect, I can choose again.

00:10:18.053 --> 00:10:19.873
So let's just play it out.

00:10:19.873 --> 00:10:21.486
You're walking around Wanderlust

00:10:21.486 --> 00:10:25.296
and somebody cuts you in
line to the pizza truck.

00:10:25.296 --> 00:10:27.766
And you know I'd be pissed.

00:10:27.766 --> 00:10:29.625
Somebody cut me in line
to that pizza truck.

00:10:29.625 --> 00:10:33.792
And you want to go like why
they cut me in line and.

00:10:34.661 --> 00:10:37.839
In that space, notice your angst.

00:10:37.839 --> 00:10:39.422
Witness your story.

00:10:40.567 --> 00:10:42.917
And instead of thinking
I'm going to fight back,

00:10:42.917 --> 00:10:45.308
think that is a call for love.

00:10:45.308 --> 00:10:49.795
Anyone who has the audacity
to cut me in the pizza line.

00:10:49.795 --> 00:10:51.335
But seriously, anyone that's rude,

00:10:51.335 --> 00:10:52.872
'cause I cut in the pizza line sometimes.

00:10:52.872 --> 00:10:53.705
I'm a cutter.

00:10:53.705 --> 00:10:55.163
(laughter)

00:10:55.163 --> 00:10:56.713
I like to cut lines.

00:10:56.713 --> 00:10:57.792
But really, what is it?

00:10:57.792 --> 00:11:00.030
It's my own insecurity being
like I got to show people

00:11:00.030 --> 00:11:01.480
that I can get ahead of the line.

00:11:01.480 --> 00:11:02.636
Whatever it is, right?

00:11:02.636 --> 00:11:05.197
Seeing it and being like
that is their call for love.

00:11:05.197 --> 00:11:07.420
That's their unconsciousness.

00:11:07.420 --> 00:11:10.170
That's their lack of mindfulness.

00:11:11.798 --> 00:11:13.653
Really, really feel
what it would feel like

00:11:13.653 --> 00:11:17.869
to be in the action of what it
is that you are dreaming of.

00:11:17.869 --> 00:11:21.752
And what does that feel like
to be on the career path

00:11:21.752 --> 00:11:22.664
that is your dream

00:11:22.664 --> 00:11:25.485
or what does it feel like to
be doing the work in the world

00:11:25.485 --> 00:11:27.712
that you've been so longing to bring forth

00:11:27.712 --> 00:11:29.575
or what does it feel like to be spreading

00:11:29.575 --> 00:11:32.504
an empowering message in a
unique and innovative way?

00:11:32.504 --> 00:11:35.996
And in the process of
gathering those feelings,

00:11:35.996 --> 00:11:37.652
we do it through meditation.

00:11:37.652 --> 00:11:40.173
Sit in your meditation for
two to three minutes a day

00:11:40.173 --> 00:11:43.064
and just allow yourself
to cultivate the feeling

00:11:43.064 --> 00:11:44.966
of what it is that you desire.

00:11:44.966 --> 00:11:47.642
I have had many experiences
throughout my life

00:11:47.642 --> 00:11:49.907
where I've just allowed
myself to be in the feeling

00:11:49.907 --> 00:11:52.100
of service or in the
feeling of excitement,

00:11:52.100 --> 00:11:53.711
of seeing myself on a stage

00:11:53.711 --> 00:11:56.164
and the feeling of seeing
myself sitting next to Oprah

00:11:56.164 --> 00:11:57.241
doing an interview.

00:11:57.241 --> 00:11:59.552
And all of those emotional feelings

00:11:59.552 --> 00:12:01.652
that came forth in my meditations

00:12:01.652 --> 00:12:04.263
became the manifestations of my life.

00:12:04.263 --> 00:12:07.518
So take very seriously the
thoughts and the feelings.

00:12:07.518 --> 00:12:09.680
When we start to shift our perceptions,

00:12:09.680 --> 00:12:12.414
when we start to see things
with a better perspective,

00:12:12.414 --> 00:12:14.400
when we start to see our experiences

00:12:14.400 --> 00:12:17.655
as obstacles turning into opportunities

00:12:17.655 --> 00:12:22.422
or a resentment as a divine
assignment to forgive more

00:12:22.422 --> 00:12:25.691
or a moment of lack as an opportunity

00:12:25.691 --> 00:12:27.336
to focus on what we're grateful for

00:12:27.336 --> 00:12:29.779
rather than focus on what we don't have.

00:12:29.779 --> 00:12:32.766
When we start to make these
shifts within our life,

00:12:32.766 --> 00:12:35.990
what begins to happen is that
we begin to have more faith

00:12:35.990 --> 00:12:37.965
in that way of being.

00:12:37.965 --> 00:12:39.365
And so the neat thing that occurs,

00:12:39.365 --> 00:12:41.826
and this has been my
experience the past six years

00:12:41.826 --> 00:12:44.883
of practicing the life of a spirit junkie,

00:12:44.883 --> 00:12:47.368
is that now, my choices,

00:12:47.368 --> 00:12:50.190
my moment to moment choices

00:12:50.190 --> 00:12:52.709
are choosing more of a
positive perspective.

00:12:52.709 --> 00:12:55.310
When there's traffic, my
first thought is okay,

00:12:55.310 --> 00:12:57.253
I welcome the traffic to go.

00:12:57.253 --> 00:12:58.663
I start to think about the way.

00:12:58.663 --> 00:13:00.352
Or if I'm supposed to be late?

00:13:00.352 --> 00:13:01.961
Maybe I'm meant to be there late.

00:13:01.961 --> 00:13:03.732
Maybe there's something greater coming.

00:13:03.732 --> 00:13:05.758
Or if something doesn't
happen the exact way

00:13:05.758 --> 00:13:07.328
that I believe it should happen,

00:13:07.328 --> 00:13:09.565
I know and my first thought is

00:13:09.565 --> 00:13:11.724
there's something way greater coming.

00:13:11.724 --> 00:13:13.951
So this is just the types
of miracles that occur

00:13:13.951 --> 00:13:16.267
and the ways that your
mind begins to shift

00:13:16.267 --> 00:13:17.761
when you start to
practice these principles

00:13:17.761 --> 00:13:19.960
in every corner of your life.

00:13:19.960 --> 00:13:21.488
I think it's really valuable for us

00:13:21.488 --> 00:13:23.238
to recognize that we,

00:13:24.326 --> 00:13:26.598
when we're on a spiritual
path, that's our path,

00:13:26.598 --> 00:13:27.967
but it's not for everybody.

00:13:27.967 --> 00:13:32.134
And not everyone wants to
know every detail of our path.

00:13:33.011 --> 00:13:35.757
We have to trust that
our shift in perception,

00:13:35.757 --> 00:13:39.535
our energetic changes are
the raising of our own energy

00:13:39.535 --> 00:13:41.769
will help raise the energy
of other people around us.

00:13:41.769 --> 00:13:44.988
And hopefully we'll start
to see how we are no longer

00:13:44.988 --> 00:13:47.965
an energetic match for the
people that don't think

00:13:47.965 --> 00:13:50.071
and feel the way that we feel.

00:13:50.071 --> 00:13:52.463
And so slowly we'll
begin to see those folks

00:13:52.463 --> 00:13:53.997
begin to melt away.

00:13:53.997 --> 00:13:55.365
We'll see them disappear.

00:13:55.365 --> 00:13:56.933
We'll see them fall off in our life

00:13:56.933 --> 00:13:59.576
and we'll see some of our
relationships begin to change.

00:13:59.576 --> 00:14:01.775
And sometimes that's a little
bit alarming for people,

00:14:01.775 --> 00:14:03.968
but it's actually a good sign.

00:14:03.968 --> 00:14:08.135
It's a sign that you are not
stuck in that pattern anymore.

00:14:10.065 --> 00:14:14.205
It's a sign that your desire
to change has been lifted

00:14:14.205 --> 00:14:17.020
and that you now are
vibrating in a new frequency

00:14:17.020 --> 00:14:19.290
and those relationships will melt away.

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:21.795
If those relationships are
still coming up for you

00:14:21.795 --> 00:14:24.235
while you're in this
path of transformation,

00:14:24.235 --> 00:14:26.505
what I often say is rather
than pointing the finger

00:14:26.505 --> 00:14:29.273
at those people saying,
"Oh, you're ruining my life.

00:14:29.273 --> 00:14:31.381
"You're making things difficult."

00:14:31.381 --> 00:14:33.684
My hope and my intention for you

00:14:33.684 --> 00:14:36.695
would be that you begin to
look at those folks and say,

00:14:36.695 --> 00:14:39.418
"What is it about me
that is still triggered

00:14:39.418 --> 00:14:40.821
"by their behavior?

00:14:40.821 --> 00:14:43.213
"What is it in me that may be attracting

00:14:43.213 --> 00:14:45.283
"this type of person into my life?

00:14:45.283 --> 00:14:46.611
"What is it within me

00:14:46.611 --> 00:14:49.258
"that is still calling in
this kind of experience?"

00:14:49.258 --> 00:14:50.784
And so get honest with yourself.

00:14:50.784 --> 00:14:52.852
What is it within me
that's calling this in?

00:14:52.852 --> 00:14:54.369
How am I participating in this

00:14:54.369 --> 00:14:58.087
and how is this experience
coming from a dark corner

00:14:58.087 --> 00:14:59.534
within my psyche?

00:14:59.534 --> 00:15:01.192
And recognizing that the outside world

00:15:01.192 --> 00:15:04.491
is always reflecting
our internal condition.

00:15:04.491 --> 00:15:05.981
And recognizing the mirror

00:15:05.981 --> 00:15:08.051
that people are always
mirroring back to us

00:15:08.051 --> 00:15:09.374
what we are feeling.

00:15:09.374 --> 00:15:11.606
So if she has people
coming up into her life,

00:15:11.606 --> 00:15:14.124
negative friends, people that are jealous,

00:15:14.124 --> 00:15:17.963
she says, "Negative people
randomly popping back in."

00:15:17.963 --> 00:15:19.641
And she wants to keep them at a distance.

00:15:19.641 --> 00:15:24.101
Well the real work is to just
open and rev up your practice.

00:15:24.101 --> 00:15:26.702
Pray for them, extend light to them,

00:15:26.702 --> 00:15:30.996
and sometimes politely excuse
yourself from the experience.

00:15:30.996 --> 00:15:32.851
Sometimes we have to remove ourselves

00:15:32.851 --> 00:15:34.166
from those experiences.

00:15:34.166 --> 00:15:36.812
And then most importantly, ask
yourself what is it within me

00:15:36.812 --> 00:15:38.874
that may be attracting
some of this behavior?

00:15:38.874 --> 00:15:40.158
Get honest with yourself.

00:15:40.158 --> 00:15:40.991
Okay.

00:15:40.991 --> 00:15:42.436
No matter what's up,

00:15:42.436 --> 00:15:44.769
choose to show up with love.

00:15:45.688 --> 00:15:47.094
Choose to show up with grace.

00:15:47.094 --> 00:15:49.581
Now if something really tough is up,

00:15:49.581 --> 00:15:52.639
maybe just choose to show
up with self compassion.

00:15:52.639 --> 00:15:53.920
If you're going through something,

00:15:53.920 --> 00:15:55.736
I'm not going to sit here and recommend

00:15:55.736 --> 00:15:57.248
that if you're going
through a traumatic period

00:15:57.248 --> 00:15:58.946
in your life, I'm not going to recommend

00:15:58.946 --> 00:16:00.318
that you wake up and you're like

00:16:00.318 --> 00:16:01.727
it's rainbows and butterflies

00:16:01.727 --> 00:16:03.537
and Gabby Bernstein Spirit Junkie App.

00:16:03.537 --> 00:16:04.442
No.

00:16:04.442 --> 00:16:06.757
That's not what I'm going to recommend.

00:16:06.757 --> 00:16:09.170
What I'm going to recommend
is you wake up and you say,

00:16:09.170 --> 00:16:12.515
"I'm going to choose to
see myself with love today.

00:16:12.515 --> 00:16:14.006
"I'm going to choose to be compassionate

00:16:14.006 --> 00:16:15.543
"and kind to myself today.

00:16:15.543 --> 00:16:17.825
"I'm going to choose to go slow today."

00:16:17.825 --> 00:16:21.885
But that's still a very,
very mindful morning, okay?

00:16:21.885 --> 00:16:24.577
And the morning is probably
the most crucial time

00:16:24.577 --> 00:16:26.597
to be conscious of your mindfulness

00:16:26.597 --> 00:16:30.033
and show up with grace and
show up with love and bring it.

00:16:30.033 --> 00:16:34.364
Bring it, bring it,
bring it in the morning.

00:16:34.364 --> 00:16:35.599
- Thank you guys so much for watching.

00:16:35.599 --> 00:16:38.244
I made this video because Kim asked me to.

00:16:38.244 --> 00:16:39.609
Also, if you want to nominate someone

00:16:39.609 --> 00:16:41.107
for the next top 10 video,

00:16:41.107 --> 00:16:43.656
please check the description
for a link to a video

00:16:43.656 --> 00:16:45.017
where you can vote for people

00:16:45.017 --> 00:16:46.907
and put in your suggestions as well.

00:16:46.907 --> 00:16:49.176
I'd love to know what did
you take from this video?

00:16:49.176 --> 00:16:52.120
What was the most important
lesson that you learned,

00:16:52.120 --> 00:16:55.218
that blew your mind, that you're
going to immediately apply

00:16:55.218 --> 00:16:57.355
to your life or your business somehow?

00:16:57.355 --> 00:16:59.050
Please leave it down
in the comments below.

00:16:59.050 --> 00:17:00.453
I'm super curious to find out.

00:17:00.453 --> 00:17:02.688
I also want to give a quick
shout out to Steph Reveron.

00:17:02.688 --> 00:17:04.591
Steph, thank you so much
for picking up a copy

00:17:04.591 --> 00:17:06.054
of my book, Your One Word,

00:17:06.054 --> 00:17:08.697
and posting another great
picture to Instagram.

00:17:08.697 --> 00:17:10.255
I really appreciate the support

00:17:10.255 --> 00:17:12.041
and I'm glad you're enjoying the read.

00:17:12.041 --> 00:17:13.607
So thank you guys again for watching.

00:17:13.607 --> 00:17:14.937
I believe in you.

00:17:14.937 --> 00:17:16.968
I hope you continue to believe in yourself

00:17:16.968 --> 00:17:20.354
and whatever your one word is, much love.

00:17:20.354 --> 00:17:21.854
I'll see you soon.

00:17:27.830 --> 00:17:30.010
- It's very easy to show up
at work every day and say,

00:17:30.010 --> 00:17:30.876
"I hate this.

00:17:30.876 --> 00:17:32.238
"I can't stand my boss.

00:17:32.238 --> 00:17:34.025
"I hate sitting next to this person.

00:17:34.025 --> 00:17:35.059
"My cubicle sucks."

00:17:35.059 --> 00:17:38.129
There's a million ways we can
get completely whacked out

00:17:38.129 --> 00:17:40.811
with the stories of why
we don't like our job.

00:17:40.811 --> 00:17:43.099
So just have fun and
lean towards the things

00:17:43.099 --> 00:17:44.751
that elevate you.

00:17:44.751 --> 00:17:47.480
And the more you focus on the
things that are fun for you

00:17:47.480 --> 00:17:50.451
and the more you focus on
the good that is around you,

00:17:50.451 --> 00:17:52.061
the more fun you become.

00:17:52.061 --> 00:17:53.679
The more cool you become.

00:17:53.679 --> 00:17:55.832
When you're in that place of you're cool,

00:17:55.832 --> 00:17:57.158
people want to do more with you.

00:17:57.158 --> 00:17:58.154
You'll get those assignments

00:17:58.154 --> 00:18:01.002
that are going to be far more exciting.

00:18:01.002 --> 00:18:02.731
The people that may be difficult

00:18:02.731 --> 00:18:06.898
in your career relationships
will start to actually change.

00:18:07.932 --> 00:18:08.803
They'll see you differently.

00:18:08.803 --> 00:18:10.173
They'll act differently around you.

00:18:10.173 --> 00:18:11.543
When you're having a good time,

00:18:11.543 --> 00:18:13.157
the people around you have a good time.

00:18:13.157 --> 00:18:15.680
And that will help you
get ahead very quickly,

00:18:15.680 --> 00:18:17.665
smoothly, and with joy.

00:18:17.665 --> 00:18:19.813
The next phase here is
also to become grateful

00:18:19.813 --> 00:18:21.385
for what it is that you do have.

00:18:21.385 --> 00:18:24.241
So if you're starting to try
to create change in your life,

00:18:24.241 --> 00:18:26.056
you want to make sure that
you're really focusing

00:18:26.056 --> 00:18:28.709
on what it is that you
do have in your life

00:18:28.709 --> 00:18:32.217
so that you feel an energy of gratitude.

00:18:32.217 --> 00:18:35.326
And an energy of gratitude
can really open you up

00:18:35.326 --> 00:18:39.149
to this incredible capacity
to feel more energized,

00:18:39.149 --> 00:18:41.006
to feel more happy.

00:18:41.006 --> 00:18:43.113
In any given moment
where you feel like oh,

00:18:43.113 --> 00:18:45.046
I don't have what I need
or I'm not supported

00:18:45.046 --> 00:18:46.535
or things aren't working out,

00:18:46.535 --> 00:18:48.689
the simple step here is to just say,

00:18:48.689 --> 00:18:50.878
"I am grateful for what I do have."

00:18:50.878 --> 00:18:52.406
And when we look and we say

00:18:52.406 --> 00:18:53.812
I am grateful for what I do have,

00:18:53.812 --> 00:18:56.243
we create more of what we want.

00:18:56.243 --> 00:18:59.826
And the energy of
gratitude opens our heart

00:19:01.283 --> 00:19:02.714
and it expands our energy

00:19:02.714 --> 00:19:06.421
and it makes us a much more
wonderful, loving person

00:19:06.421 --> 00:19:07.539
to be around.

00:19:07.539 --> 00:19:09.020
And with that loving energy,

00:19:09.020 --> 00:19:11.669
we begin to attract more into our life.

00:19:11.669 --> 00:19:13.229
And so we want to really make sure

00:19:13.229 --> 00:19:17.957
that that energy of gratitude
is a very pinnacle part

00:19:17.957 --> 00:19:20.640
of this miracle worker process,

00:19:20.640 --> 00:19:24.406
which is that we stay committed and open

00:19:24.406 --> 00:19:26.806
to what it is that we are here to receive.

00:19:26.806 --> 00:19:29.785
And we stay committed and grateful

00:19:29.785 --> 00:19:31.896
for what it is that we have.

00:19:31.896 --> 00:19:35.287
And so you can begin today
just by making a gratitude list

00:19:35.287 --> 00:19:36.563
and focus on it.

00:19:36.563 --> 00:19:38.343
And there are so many moments
when I think oh my God,

00:19:38.343 --> 00:19:39.216
I can't believe I have to do this

00:19:39.216 --> 00:19:40.615
or I can't believe I have to get to that.

00:19:40.615 --> 00:19:42.679
And then I just think
about what I'm grateful for

00:19:42.679 --> 00:19:45.669
and it just spins me immediately
out of the crazy chaos

00:19:45.669 --> 00:19:47.602
and back into a centered place of love.

00:19:47.602 --> 00:19:50.318
And so I think that this
is a really valuable tool

00:19:50.318 --> 00:19:52.262
for you to begin to use regularly

00:19:52.262 --> 00:19:53.459
and it's an active tool

00:19:53.459 --> 00:19:55.402
throughout the book May Cause Miracles.

00:19:55.402 --> 00:19:59.208
When you fully accept that
you are here to be great,

00:19:59.208 --> 00:20:01.940
when you fully accept that
you are here to be happy,

00:20:01.940 --> 00:20:04.903
when you fully accept that
you are here to receive,

00:20:04.903 --> 00:20:08.153
when you fully accept that you can have

00:20:09.433 --> 00:20:11.009
the peace and the serenity and the joy

00:20:11.009 --> 00:20:12.253
and the wisdom and the purpose

00:20:12.253 --> 00:20:15.103
and the intention that you
intend to bring to the world

00:20:15.103 --> 00:20:18.103
and that it is all available to you,

00:20:19.111 --> 00:20:21.944
that's when life gets very groovy.

00:20:22.951 --> 00:20:26.404
And so my hope and my intention for today

00:20:26.404 --> 00:20:29.084
is to wake you up to that presence

00:20:29.084 --> 00:20:30.611
and more importantly,

00:20:30.611 --> 00:20:33.508
give you a really great New
York City kick in the ass

00:20:33.508 --> 00:20:35.617
that says not only I'm awake to it,

00:20:35.617 --> 00:20:39.784
not only do I believe in it,
but I am committed to it.

00:20:40.748 --> 00:20:44.748
I am unapologetic about
my capacity to be great.

00:20:45.616 --> 00:20:48.622
I am unapologetic about
my capacity to heal.

00:20:48.622 --> 00:20:50.802
I am unapologetic about my capacity

00:20:50.802 --> 00:20:52.659
to see beyond my physical sight.

00:20:52.659 --> 00:20:56.509
I am unapologetic about
my capacity to shine

00:20:56.509 --> 00:20:59.659
as bright as I can shine
because I trust and I know

00:20:59.659 --> 00:21:01.360
that when I shine bright,

00:21:01.360 --> 00:21:04.497
I give others permission to do the same

00:21:04.497 --> 00:21:07.247
and in my glow, they wake up too.

00:21:08.585 --> 00:21:10.835
And that is why we're here.

00:21:12.595 --> 00:21:14.845
(applause)

